- The integer array parameter `nums` must not be null.
- The length of the integer array parameter `nums` is greater than or equal to 1 and is less than or equal to 6.
- All values in the integer array parameter `nums` are unique.
- The size of the list result is equal to the factorial of the length of the integer array parameter `nums`.
- Each element in the list result is a permutation of the integer array parameter `nums`.
- The order of permutations in the list result can be in any order.